Homebridge LG ThinQ - RobotPool maintenance fork

This product is a modified version of Homebridge LG ThinQ
(https://github.com/nVuln/homebridge-lg-thinq), originally created by
nVuln and its contributors, and licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). All original copyright notices are retained.

The RobotPool maintenance fork is published at
https://github.com/RobotPool/homebridge-lg-thinq and is based on upstream
commit c50f246e7f1945ad9ad227cf8b53ad6fbb224613. Upstream did not tag the
2.0.0 betas; that commit declares version 2.0.0 in package.json, and
building it (npm ci && npm run build) produces a dist/ directory that is
byte-for-byte identical to the one in the npm release
homebridge-lg-thinq@2.0.0-beta.8 (checked with diff -r on 2026-11-01).

Files changed by the RobotPool maintainers (see git history for details):

  src/lib/Auth.ts          EMP OAuth signing via LG's /spx/signature service,
                           authorization code exchange, response validation
                           and clearer auth errors
  src/lib/request.ts       non-Axios default User-Agent; request details
                           hidden from logged and serialized errors
  src/lib/ThinQ.ts         request debug log without query or account id
  src/cli.ts               accepted browser login redirect and code exchange;
                           message-only errors
  src/lib/Auth.spec.ts     signature mock instead of searchKey
  src/lib/request.spec.ts  User-Agent and redaction tests
  src/settings.ts          npm package name; cache directory constant
  src/lib/API.ts           no automatic terms acceptance; one clear message
  src/errors/ManualProcessNeeded.ts  shared terms message
  src/platformAccessories.spec.ts  package name in expectations
  tsconfig.json            exclude src/testing from the build
  CHANGELOG.md, README.md, package.json, package-lock.json (name and version)

Files added by the RobotPool maintainers:

  NOTICE, README.zh-CN.md, docs/robotpool-fork.md, docs/robotpool-fork.zh-CN.md,
  src/lib/Auth.oauth.spec.ts, src/lib/API.auth.spec.ts, src/settings.spec.ts,
  .github/workflows/publish.yml,
  src/testing/fakeLgCloud.ts (test-only, not published)

